Ported third-party code
=======================

src/zgo_index.c builds packed R-trees and k-d trees in the serialised
formats of flatbush v4.7.0 and kdbush v4.1.0, written step for step from
their index.js, and src/zgo_kernel.c's zgo_hilbert() is flatbush's hilbert()
function line for line (itself the public-domain "Fast Hilbert curve
algorithm" by rawrunprotected). flatbush (https://github.com/mourner/flatbush)
and kdbush (https://github.com/mourner/kdbush) are by Vladimir Agafonkin,
under the ISC license:

